---
---

<section id="educacion" style="padding: 80px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-carbon); background: rgba(19, 19, 26, 0.4);">
  <div class="container-custom">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">
      <div class="f1-badge f1-badge-cyan" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> DRIVER ACADEMY & CERTIFICATIONS
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-f1 text-gradient-f1" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        FORMACIÓN Y CERTIFICACIONES
      </h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 0.95rem;">
        Academia técnica y acreditaciones en ingeniería de software y desarrollo full stack.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Education Timeline & Grid -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 2rem;" class="edu-grid">
      
      <!-- Left: Academic Background -->
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;">
        
        <!-- SENATI -->
        <div class="f1-card" style="padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.25rem;">
          <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(225, 6, 0, 0.15); border: 1px solid var(--f1-red); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--f1-red); font-family: var(--font-f1); font-weight: 900; font-size: 0.9rem; shrink: 0;">
            SENATI
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 4px;">
              <h3 className="font-f1" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #fff;">Servicio Nacional de Adiestramiento en Trabajo Industrial</h3>
              <span class="f1-badge f1-badge-green" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">2023 - 2025</span>
            </div>
            <div style="color: var(--cyan-telemetry); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem;">Desarrollador de Software</div>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin-top: 6px;">
              Formación profesional intensiva en desarrollo de software, algoritmos, arquitectura de sistemas y bases de datos relacionales.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Digital House -->
        <div class="f1-card" style="padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.25rem;">
          <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid var(--cyan-telemetry); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--cyan-telemetry); font-family: var(--font-f1); font-weight: 900; font-size: 0.8rem; shrink: 0;">
            DH
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 4px;">
              <h3 className="font-f1" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #fff;">Digital House</h3>
              <span class="f1-badge f1-badge-cyan" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">2023 - 2024</span>
            </div>
            <div style="color: var(--cyan-telemetry); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem;">Certified Tech Developer</div>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin-top: 6px;">
              Especialización práctica en metodologías ágiles, trabajo colaborativo en equipo e ingeniería de software moderna.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Silabuz Bootcamp -->
        <div class="f1-card" style="padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.25rem;">
          <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(255, 230, 0, 0.1); border: 1px solid var(--yellow-speed); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--yellow-speed); font-family: var(--font-f1); font-weight: 900; font-size: 0.8rem; shrink: 0;">
            SLB
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 4px;">
              <h3 className="font-f1" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #fff;">Silabuz Bootcamp</h3>
              <span class="f1-badge" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">2022 - 2023</span>
            </div>
            <div style="color: var(--yellow-speed); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem;">Desarrollador Web Backend</div>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin-top: 6px;">
              Fundamentos avanzados de desarrollo web backend, APIs RESTful y gestión de bases de datos.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right: Agile Methodologies & Tools -->
      <div class="f1-card" style="padding: 1.75rem; border-top: 3px solid var(--f1-red); height: fit-content;">
        <h3 class="font-f1" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check" style="color: var(--f1-red);"></i> RACE STRATEGY & AGILE
        </h3>

        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          Dominio y experiencia de trabajo colaborativo bajo marcos ágiles estándar de la industria tecnológica:
        </p>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
          <div style="padding: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid var(--border-carbon); border-radius: 4px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-f1); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem;">SCRUM</span>
            <span class="f1-badge f1-badge-red" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">AGILE</span>
          </div>

          <div style="padding: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid var(--border-carbon); border-radius: 4px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-f1); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem;">KANBAN</span>
            <span class="f1-badge f1-badge-cyan" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">WORKFLOW</span>
          </div>

          <div style="padding: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid var(--border-carbon); border-radius: 4px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-f1); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem;">JIRA & CONFLUENCE</span>
            <span class="f1-badge f1-badge-green" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">MANAGEMENT</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 868px) {
    .edu-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    }
  }
</style>
